====Crouch C====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=kim_crC
|description=* Wild Punish +16 (+22 when feint cancelled)
* For a far heavy, great range and speed, but not great on block
* Looks like a low, but hits mid 
Great combo filler, great whiff punish, great at a lot of things due to its speed and reach. This is also your most reliable link from a feint-cancelled close heavy, as it’s faster than far C while also hitting crouch (albeit with a smidge less damage and range).

Having it blocked ends your turn unless you spend REV, however, so be mindful of your resources when using it in neutral.
}}

====Crouch D====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=kim_crD
|description=* Kaphwan’s longest-ranged attack to come out in less than 10 frames
