====Jump C====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=kim_jC
|description=* A strong air normal that juggles ''and'' special cancels
* Worse startup and range than Kaphwan’s other air normals
Kaphwan’s j.C is interesting. You can cancel and combo out of it like a grounded normal, or juggle from it to something on the ground, like a flashkick. Any way you land it and follow it up, is insanely rewarding. 

The problem is that it’s much more difficult to hit than it looks, due to its poor reach and startup. You’ll mainly look to hit it off a Counter Hit launch (such as from 214B), which leads to combos that do absurd damage, especially in the corner.
