====Jump D====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=kim_jD
|description=* Kaphwan’s longest-ranged air normal
* Has a second hit that only hits cross-up
Kaphwan’s primary jump-in, with good range as well. On top of starting combos after jumping in, its reach also gives it use as a retreating air-to-air.

There is also a second hit that only hits cross-up, similar to Dong Hwan’s Mule Kick. While it’s fantastic for that purpose, you’ll want a proper setup for it due to taking 14 frames to come out. Without a hard knockdown or the corner, j.B is much easier to use a cross-up.
}}

