==REV Blows==
====Sting Dwi Dora Chagi====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=kim_CD
|description=Kaphwan steps into a spinning high kick.
* Damage value factors in S.P.G. bonus
* MASSIVE range, hitting almost half-screen 
This REV Blow has a way bigger hitbox than it looks. This allows you to brute-force through mid-range, and it’s possible to use it as a fireball punish because it reaches so far. It’s nearly impossible to punish on block, or even on whiff if your opponent isn’t looking out for it. 

Aside from its obvious utility, this is extremely integral to Kaphwan’s offense in S.P.G., since Kaphwan needs a hard knockdown in his combos to push strong okizeme midscreen. 
